            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You are no rime hag or Jadwiga, but the magic of the north has still left a mark on you.\n\nFrigid ice runs through your veins, and you can expel frost from your body to freeze your foes. Attempt an Athletics check against the Fortitude DC of an adjacent foe.\n\nIf you have master proficiency in Athletics, you can affect up to two adjacent foes, rolling one Athletics check against each foe.\n\nCritical Success: The target becomes clumsy 2 for 1 round.\nSuccess: The target becomes clumsy 1 for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: The target is temporarily immune for 1 minute."
            }
          }
